From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:43:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reshape only text that names a newly registered web font
 family

A web font arriving after the first layout damaged every inline layout in the document,
so a face used by one table on html.spec.whatwg.org cost a full 740k-node relayout.
Only text whose font-family names the registered family can shape differently; reshape
those inline roots and the inline roots above them. A face with no family name still
reshapes everything.

The damage is applied at the next resolve rather than on each delivery, so a page that
receives N faces walks its nodes once instead of N times.
---
 src/document.rs      | 29 +++++++++++++++--
 src/layout/damage.rs | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/resolve.rs       |  8 +++++
 3 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/document.rs b/src/document.rs
index b5fbd06..8d4090d 100644
--- a/src/document.rs
+++ b/src/document.rs
@@ -306,6 +306,12 @@ pub struct BaseDocument {
